68,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105755.789059,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":115721.784554,"text":"مزاجرس اپنے وقت کا سب سے بڑا شکار خور تھا اس لیے وہ دیگر مزاجرس کے علاوہ کسی ضخائف نہیں ہوتا تھا"},{"kind":"text","t":116778.279309,"text":"Mazajras was the greatest predator of its time, so it did not prey on anything other than other Mazajras."},{"kind":"audio","t":116947.948957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116953.07768999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116958.163833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116963.636039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116969.00188699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116972.282401,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":122727.56612799999,"text":"میں انیسویس کی بنیاد پیراگے اپنا دیسے کردار روشناک کو برقرار رکھنے میں کامیاب رہا"},{"kind":"text","t":123484.001964,"text":"In the foundation of nineteen, Parage succeeded in maintaining the bright character of his country."},{"kind":"audio","t":123598.938838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123603.985612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123609.478908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123614.751458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123619.602365,"samples":32128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":127743.08347499999,"text":"یہ مرض پہلے سوٹ میں پیدا ہوتا ہے پھر مچھل اس کو انسانوں کو منتقل کرتے ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":128458.507192,"text":"This disease first develops in the suit, and then fish transfer it to humans."},{"kind":"audio","t":128647.633008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128656.296309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1