کے طور پر مشامل کیا گیا تھا"},{"kind":"text","t":150132.557864,"text":"So it is possible that the symbol was included merely as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":150245.94581499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150249.019153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150252.412675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150254.227124,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":156464.47208099999,"text":"لیکن ان چیڈیو کی نسبت سے بہت سی باتیں جو ڈائنوس اور جیسی لگتی ہیں"},{"kind":"text","t":156993.580214,"text":"But regarding these videos, many things seem like dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":157179.913677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157186.72539099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157191.966581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157193.479825,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":167356.208957,"text":"وہ تقریبا ریتیل ساحل ہیں جو تراکی کے لئے محفوظ ہیں اور زیادہ تر میں سایہ ہوتا ہے جو کہ بہت کعویٰ کے درخت فراہم کرتا ہے"},{"kind":"text","t":168368.89817,"text":"They are almost sandy beaches that are preserved for development, and for the most part, there is shade provided by many crow trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":168487.66331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168492.655874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168497.958203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":168503.196894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":168508.404125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168513.613266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168515.946346,"samples":15792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":173269.87409599999,"text":"دو بڑے بچے کے والد شادی شدہ ڈیو